        <mxCell id="p3_s5" value="&lt;b&gt;⑤ Wallet keeps&lt;/b&gt; smartAccount = true and a built-in authenticator.&lt;br&gt;The RPC returns every active link; this filter runs in the wallet.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;✔ &lt;b&gt;A1&lt;/b&gt;: ed25519, the wallet can sign with K&lt;br&gt;✔ &lt;b&gt;A2&lt;/b&gt;: ed25519, the wallet can sign with K&lt;br&gt;✘ A3: custom authenticator, found but the IOTA wallet cannot sign&lt;br&gt;✘ O5: not a SmartAccount (a third-party object)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Unlockable by K: A1, A2&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;strokeColor=#000000;arcSize=8;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;fillColor=#FFFFFF;fillColor=#D5E8D4;" vertex="1" parent="p3_1">
